         FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], " and returns ", 
        Cell[BoxData[ButtonBox["SparseArray", BaseStyle -> "Link", 
           ButtonData -> "paclet:ref/SparseArray"]], "InlineFormula", 
         FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], 
        " matrices. For generator indices ", 
